result
result-*
.direnv
.env
.obsidian
# Local scratch design notes (root only — anchored so it never catches a
# tracked `project/design` scaffold or a nested `design/` elsewhere).
/design
# Cargo build output. lib.rust steers cargo at an out-of-tree CARGO_TARGET_DIR
# in the dev shell, but an ad-hoc `cargo build` lands here.
/target
# Obsidian per-vault editor state (local layout + a vendored plugin binary),
# created when the kanban board is opened in Obsidian. Not shared config.
.obsidian/
# lib.markdown stages its generated Prettier ignore file at the repo root for
# the duration of a `format`/`lint` run (Prettier resolves ignore patterns
# relative to the file's own directory). It is removed on exit, including on
# Ctrl-C — this only catches the litter a SIGKILL would leave.
.prettierignore.*
